            "reviewBody": "As I don’t like coriander (cilantro) I substituted parsley = BUT I added a couple of sprigs to the sauce for the last 4-5 mins - then removed the sprigs and added freshly chopped parsley to the sauce just before serving. I also added a little freshly ground salt to the initial ingredients. We spooned generous amounts of the sauce over our lobster and it was YUM!!",
